# ==============================================================================
# Niruvi Store - Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# No mandatory environment variables are required to run Niruvi Store.
# The database runs on Google Cloud SQL, and session authentication includes safe defaults.
#
# Optional: If you wish to enable a payment gateway:
# - For India: UPI QR codes work with 0 API keys; Razorpay is the primary Indian gateway.
# - For International: Stripe or GitHub Sponsors.
# ==============================================================================
